    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrical Repair theme is a modern, responsive, and professional solution designed for electricians, electrical service providers, electrical contractors, residential and commercial electrical services, industrial electricians, and technical agencies offering electrical repair, installation, maintenance, wiring solutions, emergency electrician support, power backup solutions, home automation services, generator installation, and electrical safety services. Ideal for showcasing services like electrical troubleshooting, circuit repairs, lighting installations, and energy-efficient solutions, the theme provides a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for service highlights, banners, Call to Action (CTA) buttons, team profiles, testimonials, and interactive galleries to engage clients effectively. Built with clean, optimized code, it allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to reflect your brand identity. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for service bookings and payments, Contact Form 7 for inquiries and lead capture, and WPML for multilingual support, the Electrical Repair theme offers a professional, SEO-friendly, and high-performing platform for growing your electrical services business online."
    },
